{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ekholux\u2122 \u2014  A massive physics playground for players hungry for something new.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large-scale spatial puzzles and high-speed movement inside vast open environments, where experimentation, timing, and spatial control define every challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playing Physics at the Edge of Scale</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch sound spheres through long-span environments that stretch across the space, built far beyond the scale of traditional puzzle spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bounce pads, reflectors, and angled surfaces to shape each path. There is no fixed solution \u2014 experiment, chain bounces, and discover your own way. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour at the Edge of Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When puzzles end, movement becomes the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide, wall-run, parkour, and skate across vast suspended structures at extreme speed, where your speed, angles, and body control shape every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial and error is encouraged \u2014 respawn instantly, experiment freely, and imagine new ways to move, grind, and link unexpected paths through the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playground where paths emerge through play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Curious VR Players</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love to explore, experiment, and learn through play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where interaction, space, and sound respond to what you try \u2014 not what you're told.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Feature</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, full-body VR flight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into high-speed VR Esports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape sealed chambers through Physics\u00a0mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide sound paths through playful interactions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to experience VR in a different way?</strong> <strong>Play with possibilities. Explore the space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49Add Ekholux to your Wishlist and download the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Release Timeline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Release\uff5c2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915940?t=1767005817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915940?t=1767005817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915940/27ceb01f3fa5b095f887cd2c200d3f120066b259/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767005817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915940/27ceb01f3fa5b095f887cd2c200d3f120066b259/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767005817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3915960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ekholux\u2122 \u2014  A massive physics playground for players hungry for something new.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large-scale spatial puzzles and high-speed movement inside vast open environments, where experimentation, timing, and spatial control define every challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playing Physics at the Edge of Scale</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch sound spheres through long-span environments that stretch across the space, built far beyond the scale of traditional puzzle spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bounce pads, reflectors, and angled surfaces to shape each path. There is no fixed solution \u2014 experiment, chain bounces, and discover your own way. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour at the Edge of Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When puzzles end, movement becomes the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide, wall-run, parkour, and skate across vast suspended structures at extreme speed, where your speed, angles, and body control shape every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial and error is encouraged \u2014 respawn instantly, experiment freely, and imagine new ways to move, grind, and link unexpected paths through the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playground where paths emerge through play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Curious VR Players</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love to explore, experiment, and learn through play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where interaction, space, and sound respond to what you try \u2014 not what you're told.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Feature</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, full-body VR flight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into high-speed VR Esports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape sealed chambers through Physics\u00a0mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide sound paths through playful interactions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to experience VR in a different way?</strong> <strong>Play with possibilities. Explore the space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49Add Ekholux to your Wishlist and dow